  "description": "The paladin raises a hand to the heavens. A ring of holy script opens on the ground under the target and a point of light gathers high above it; then a pillar of white-gold light slams straight down onto the target, wound with spiralling threads, pours down for a long moment with light rising off the ground, and narrows away to nothing, leaving the sigil glowing.",
