    "reads": {
      "front": "A tall bright column drops in front of the camera onto the target, with the sigil a flat ellipse at its foot and motes rising round it.",
      "side": "The best read of the pillar: a full-height column of light from the top of the frame to the ground, spirals winding down it, a shockwave ring on the ground.",
      "top": "The pillar collapses to a blinding disc, so the ground carries it: the sigil opening, the shockwave ring and the halo rings pulsing out under the column.",
      "three_quarter": "Hero view. The light gathering in the sky, the column dropping, the spirals and the sigil all read together."
    }
